n with line icons, titles (\'Friendly Team\', \'Perfect Venues\', \'Unique Scenarios\', \'Unforgettable Time\'), short descriptions, and small red/orange links.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Consistent Aesthetic & Animations",\n      "description": "Warm, party-themed color palette, drop shadows, smooth scrolling, fade-in content, and hover effects for a professional, welcoming vibe.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Mobile & Tablet Friendly",\n      "description": "Fully responsive layout using Tailwind CSS, semantic HTML, and visual balance for all devices.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#FF6F61",\n    "secondary": "#FFB88C",\n    "accent": "#FF5E62"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "Top info bar with contact/socials (right), logo (left) and navbar (right) below. Hero section with full-width background, gradient overlay, centered heading and animated buttons. Four-column services section with icons, titles, descriptions, and links. Clean, balanced, and responsive layout using Tailwind CSS, with cursive logo and sans-serif content font. Drop shadows, hover effects, and smooth animations throughout. Mobile and tablet friendly with semantic HTML structure."\n}'}",
